# Devices netcap manages. One device per line: "name OS route"
#   name   used as in netcap status <name>. "all" is reserved
#   OS     one of mac (pf + dummynet), linux (tc), win (NetQosPolicy)
#   route  a Host name from ~/.ssh/config, or - for the machine running netcap itself
#
# netcap install adds lines here; you can also write them by hand.
laptop   mac  -
server   mac  server
gamepc   win  gamepc
